1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Ek shared function badalne se kahan-kahan asar padega?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Is demo mein actual CLI results se poora workflow dekho.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Repository kholo aur jis function ko badalna hai, uska symbol chuno.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Yahan validate_order ek se sau tak ki quantity accept karta hai.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
trace-callers se dekho ki kaunse functions is validator ko call karte hain.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Har connection ke saath source file aur line reference milta hai.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
inspect-change-impact se connected API endpoints bhi milte hain.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Is validator ka asar orders aur orders preview, dono endpoints tak pahunch sakta
hai.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
related-tests se testing ki focused checklist banao.

10
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Yahan chaar tests mile. HTTP path matches ko candidate label diya gaya hai.

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Code badalne se pehle baseline save karo.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Is ID se edit ke baad purane aur naye investigation ko compare karoge.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Ab demo mein quantity limit sau se pachaas karte hain.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Callers wahi reh sakte hain, lekin function ka behavior badal gaya.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Ab current Git diff par investigation dobara chalao.

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Tool changed validator aur usse connected endpoints dikhata hai.

17
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Compare body change detect karta hai, chahe connections same hon.

18
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Naya express endpoint add karne par added route bhi dikhai deta hai.

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Ab related tests khud run karo. Investigation command tests execute nahi karti.

20
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Teen tests fail hue. Purane tests ab bhi quantity sau ko valid maante hain.

21
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Tool context aur evidence deta hai. Har runtime effect prove nahi karta.

22
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Dynamic calls aur candidate matches ko review karo. Core analysis ko AI key nahi
chahiye.

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Agla code change karne se pehle trace, baseline aur comparison use karo.
